    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d223">

                <pb facs="0404" n="364" sameAs="frus:frus1865p1/pg364"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Adams to Mr.
                        Hunter</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 956.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-05-18"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 18, 1865</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> * * * * * * * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am again called upon to forward a large number of addresses and resolutions
                    from different parts of the kingdom, occasioned by the late painful events. A
                    list of them is appended as usual.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">William Hunter,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of State, Washington, D.
                        C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d223-a1.xml" xpointer="d223-a1"/>
            </div>
